---
import {experience} from '../data/experience';
import Marketing from '../layouts/Marketing.astro';
import EngagementContact from '../components/EngagementContact.astro';
import ReviewNote from '../components/ReviewNote.astro';
---
<Marketing title="Company" description="Onchain Bureau provides CEX market making and DEX concentrated-liquidity management through non-custodial engagements with client reporting.">
 <section class="service-hero"><p class="section-kicker">Onchain Bureau</p><h1>Focused on the work<br/>behind liquidity.</h1><div class="service-lead"><p>Operating since 2022, we provide market making for exchanges, token projects and tokenized assets, across centralized and decentralized markets.</p><a class="home-button" href="#contact">Discuss your market</a></div></section>
 <section class="editorial-section" aria-labelledby="company-model"><div><h2 id="company-model">An operating service<br/>around your market.</h2></div><div><p>Our work spans exchange order books, stablecoins, utility and layer-one tokens, and gemstone-backed token projects with both CEX and DEX markets. You allocate the liquidity capital; we manage the agreed quoting or position activity for a fee.</p><p>The service is non-custodial, using CEX API access or roles and permissions through Safe or Squads vaults. The existing client dashboard provides visibility into market and order activity, accounting and liquidity metrics.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/market-making">CEX market making</a><a href="/dex-liquidity-management">DEX liquidity management</a></div></div></section>
 <section class="editorial-section" aria-labelledby="experience-clients"><div><h2 id="experience-clients">Markets we have<br/>worked on.</h2></div><div>{experience.examples.map(item=><p><strong>{item.name}</strong><br/>{item.description}</p>)}</div></section>
 <section class="editorial-section" aria-labelledby="people-title"><div><h2 id="people-title">Know who is responsible<br/>for your market.</h2></div><div><p>Meet Nicholas van Eerde and Nahuel Angelone. Discuss your market with us and establish the people responsible for operation, technical access and client communication.</p><p>Our emphasis is visibility into the work: orders, market data and the measures agreed in your SLA. Human trade operations monitor books 24/7, supported by internal logging, dashboards and alerts.</p><a href="/work#controls">Access and operating questions</a></div></section>
 <ReviewNote title="Add named people and verified experience" items={['Provide names, roles, approved biographies and public profile links for the people responsible for trading, engineering and client communication.','For each person, identify relevant markets operated, systems built, responsibilities and dates. Separate previous-employer experience from Onchain Bureau history.','Supply approved portraits if wanted. Do not add anonymous stock portraits, invented combined years or implied employer endorsements.','Confirm the contracting entity, registration details, location and company history before adding a company facts panel.']}/>
 <ReviewNote title="Add one defensible engagement example" items={['Identify a permitted named client or an anonymised engagement supported by underlying records.','Record starting conditions, capital, market dates, scope, outcome and limitations. Show comparable measurements rather than an unsupported before/after uplift.','Approve any testimonial verbatim with its attribution and permission.']}/>
 <EngagementContact subject="Onchain Bureau team and services enquiry"/>
</Marketing>
